use firn/tags

gnumeric is a Module
gnumeric is tagged office

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.gnumeric.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.gnumeric]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."gnumeric"."enable": enable "Gnumeric lightweight spreadsheet (xlsx/ods/csv viewer)"
